      "slug": "personalized-3d-naming-gift",
      "short_description": null,
      "description": "✨ See the joy in every moment – that's how it feels to give a personal gift ✨ When grandma gets her very own gift – pure happiness! A gift filled with love: the children's name always close to the heart The surprise from him – a gift to remember forever What our customers say Key features • Unique design – two names are combined in a creative and artistic way. • Swedish craftsmanship – made locally in Sweden 🇸🇪 with high quality. • Available in multiple sizes – choose from small, medium or large to suit your needs. • Fully customizable – choose name, date, colors and details. • Elegant décor"
